<article class="wrap">

  <p>Pricing sabse confusing part hai ek naye editor ke liye — na kam maango ki apna kaam sasta lage, na zyada maango ki client bhaag jaaye. Iska koi ek "correct number" nahi hai, lekin market ka ek clear range hai jisme experienced editors kaam karte hain. Yahan wahi range, breakdown ke saath, samjhaya gaya hai — kya lena chahiye beginner stage mein, kaise rate scale karni hai experience ke saath, aur kaunse skills actually premium justify karte hain.</p>

